# Portable Trusted Linux Prototype 1 package seed
# Keep this deliberately small. Exact installed versions are recorded per build.
# Do not seed the full systemd-boot integration package into the live root.
# It registers kernel/dpkg hooks that expect an ESP and can fail inside the
# live-build chroot. UKI tooling remains available through systemd-ukify;
# boot-manager binaries can be staged separately when the UKI phase requires them.

systemd
systemd-ukify
linux-image-amd64
cryptsetup-bin
tpm2-tools
sbsigntool
openssl
jq
ca-certificates
curl
pciutils
usbutils
util-linux
kmod
